msgid ""
"Keep a bilingual, AI-readable map of **this git tree** so humans and "
"assistants can locate code, understand architecture, and verify changes. "
"English MyST under `man/` is the working source. Deterministic scripts "
"refresh facts into `man/_generated/`. Humans (with targeted AI) merge "
"those facts into numbered topic pages plus [C "
"Runtime](../1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md). Sphinx HTML and AgentBox are"
" derived outputs."
msgstr ""
"为 **本 git 树** 保留一份双语、可供 AI 阅读的地图，方便人和助手定位代码、理解架构并核对变更。`man/` 下的英文 MyST "
"是工作源。确定性脚本把事实刷新到 `man/_generated/`。人类（配合定向 AI）把这些事实合并进编号页面 "
"`00`–`12`。Sphinx HTML 和 AgentBox 是派生输出。"

