#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:35
#: ff4485dc222748cd92df8730bb50ba17
msgid ""
"Run Level 1 scripts first (`make pkb-level1`). Merge facts from "
"`_generated/` into the affected human pages. Use a targeted LLM pass only"
" for Level 2 synthesis (diff + those pages + the sidecar artifacts — not "
"the whole tree)."
msgstr ""
"先跑 Level 1 脚本（`make pkb-level1`）。把 `_generated/` 里的事实合并进受影响的人工页面。Level 2 "
"综合只用定向 LLM（diff + 那些页面 + 附属产物 — 不是整棵树）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:36
#: 7ca895f5a0214dbe829f4c81061d6d12
msgid ""
"Stamp the metadata footer (`last_updated`, `commit`, `updated_by`). Leave"
" `review_status: pending` unless a human is approving."
msgstr ""
"盖上元数据页脚（`last_updated`、`commit`、`updated_by`）。除非人类正在批准，否则保持 "
"`review_status: pending`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:37
#: 40c24c253acd40a2b083706d1cb4b413
msgid ""
"After English wording changes: run the explicit catalog refresh (`make "
"gettext && make intl-update`), fill new `msgstr` values, then rebuild "
"HTML. Normal HTML builds consume the tracked catalogs and do not rewrite "
"them."
msgstr ""
"英文措辞更改后：运行显式目录刷新（`make gettext && make intl-update`），填写新的 `msgstr` "
"值，然后重新构建 HTML。普通 HTML 构建会使用已跟踪的目录，不会重写它们。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:38
