msgid ""
"**Level 1 — Automatic (zero token):** tree snapshots, Sphinx-dep "
"inventory, index candidate, staleness/i18n reports, changelog draft, "
"confidential strip, AgentBox `files.ts`. Run `make pkb-level1` (and the "
"specific script if you only need one artifact). Stop if the sidecar is "
"enough for a mechanical merge (path rename, version bump)."
msgstr ""
"**Level 1 — 自动（零 token）：** 树快照、Sphinx 依赖盘点、index 候选、过期/i18n 报告、changelog "
"草稿、密级剥离、AgentBox `files.ts`。跑 `make pkb-"
"level1`（若只要一件产物则跑对应脚本）。若附属产物已足够做机械合并（路径改名、版本号），就停。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:80
#: c87d2e83651a4172a2d088d6b97cf34b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Level 2 — LLM-assisted:** new/removed modules, ESL/event contract "
"wording, build/CI narrative, workflow traces. Handoff package: git diff +"
" the published page(s) + only the relevant `_generated/` files (for "
"example `03-repo-map.generated.md` into [Repository "
"Map](../1.architecture/03-repo-map.md), `02-tech-stack.generated.md` into"
" [Tech Stack](../1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md), changelog draft into "
"[CHANGELOG](../7.appendix/01-changelog.md) / "
"[Build](../4.development/02-build.md)). Set `review_status: pending` "
"after a substantive rewrite."
msgstr ""
"**Level 2 — LLM 辅助：** 新增/删除模块、ESL/事件契约措辞、构建/CI 叙述、工作流追踪。交接包：git diff + "
"已发布页面 + 仅相关 `_generated/` 文件（例如把 `04-repo-map.generated.md` 合进 [仓库地图](04"
"-repo-map.md)，把 `03-tech-stack.generated.md` 合进 [技术栈](03-tech-stack.md)，把"
" changelog 草稿合进 [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) / [构建](08-build.md)）。实质性改写后设 "
"`review_status: pending`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/5.operations/03-document.md:81
